{
  "slug": "session-continuity",
  "name": "Session Continuity",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Cross-session memory for Claude Code projects via two in-repo docs: SESSION_PRIMER.md (current state) and LEARNINGS.md (hard-won bugs).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **4 commands** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `session-continuity` (Establish and maintain cross-session memory for a project via two in-repo docs — .session-continuity/SESSION_PRIMER.md (current state, refreshed alongside…)\n- **Commands** (4): `end-session` (Refresh the primer, surface LEARNINGS candidates from this session, and report a close-out checklist), `learning` (Append a new entry to .session-continuity/LEARNINGS.md interactively), `primer` (Init, migrate, refresh, or check .session-continuity/SESSION_PRIMER.md — dispatches based on current state), `spike-check` (Emit the stand-in spike checklist BEFORE a spike, so it's designed to hit the real binary + auth/lifecycle/fixed-port…)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install session-continuity@claude-community` from `talgolan/session-continuity`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "hook": 2,
    "command": 4
  },
